      "value": "Unable to edit post somehow\n\nTo reiterate it doesn’t happen all the time but I’ve had to try join an instance multiple times and it took 3 tries to get it to finally work\n\nI select a world create new instance I tend to select friends + but have had it happen before with invite only\n\nCreate instances and go to it and there’s a possibility it instead sends you to your home world",
