  "details": "Occasionally if you try to go to a new world it takes multiple tries before you can finally go there it sends you to your home world \n\nFor context it isn’t low memory because it doesn’t bring up the notification that you’re sent home because you ran out of memory \n\nMy friend on pc is reporting the same issue on pc he’s working on a world and it sometimes just sends him to his home world without trying to load the new world at all\n\nIt also happens when joining a friend too\n\nA way to avoid the glitch is to only use portals they seem to work perfectly fine",
